&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry Experience: Deep experience shaping enterprise AI strategy at leading enterprise software companies in DevOps, observability, monitoring, incident management, infrastructure software, or IT operations platforms&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
