&lt;li&gt;Experience managing high-value accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of success with multi-product sales and solution-based selling models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise software ecosystems, Operations Cloud, or DevOps environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with exceptional communication, negotiation, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
