&lt;li&gt;Experience carrying a pager and opinions about what good looks like in incident management and reliability processes, especially with AI in the mix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in 1–2 programming languages, familiarity with APIs, and the ability to quickly get productive in unfamiliar environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A public body of work (e.g., writing, talks, demos, code repositories, videos, or streams).&lt;/li&gt;
