&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work effectively with global and distributed teams in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a ‘can-do’ and curious attitude and a customer-focused approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess solid business acumen and strong program/project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to prioritise among competing priorities and are highly detail-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
