&lt;li&gt;Bachelors of Business, Human Resources or other relevant degree,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of related experience in Human Resources organization, preferably in SaaS or hi-tech industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 years previous experience as an HR Business Partner or HR Generalist supporting employees and people managers across technical, customer-facing, and corporate&amp;nbsp; roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing complex global employee relations cases and supporting organizational programs.&lt;/li&gt;
