&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders to configure, test, and deliver AI-enabled features and automation within Workday, acting as a key contributor in bringing new AI-powered HR products from pilot to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools in your own day-to-day work — for tasks like data analysis, documentation, testing, or reporting — to increase personal and team efficiency and free up time for higher-value work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, Legal, and IT on responsible AI governance: data privacy, access controls, and change management for AI-enabled business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain data integrity across systems by running audits, analyzing data, and correcting discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the Workday community (Brainstorm, Community forums, release notes) to stay current on system and AI capabilities, and recommend solutions that address evolving business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
