&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of Workday experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with all Workday modules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a fast-paced, growth-focused company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to improve personal or team productivity (e.g., automating reporting, documentation, or testing) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workday Pro Certification in any module (e.g., HCM, Benefits, Payroll, Advanced Compensation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping deliver AI-powered features or products as part of an HR technology roadmap — configuring, testing, and rolling out new AI capabilities to end users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile or Scrum certification.&lt;/li&gt;
